    "folder": "03_fundamental",
    "title": "现代基本面分析与财务建模",
    "title_en": "Modern Fundamental Analysis & Financial Modeling",
    "desc": "三张财务报表勾稽穿透、FCFF/FCFE 严密核算、DCF 敏感性分析与 Beneish M-Score 机构排雷系统。",
    "icon": "📈",
